the customers potentially,

00:09:47.480 --> 00:09:49.430
or how long the
people are there.

00:09:49.430 --> 00:09:51.440
So we can get an idea
of the foot traffic.

00:09:51.440 --> 00:09:54.010
And that kind of gives
us the real-time idea of,

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:56.270
OK, there's [INAUDIBLE]
people walked in,

00:09:56.270 --> 00:09:57.860
and those sort of things.

00:09:57.860 --> 00:10:02.780
And we feed all this data
